{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 10,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Vision of the Scroll"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to me, “Son of man, stand upon your feet, and I will speak with you.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he spoke to me, the Spirit entered into me and set me upon my feet; and I heard him speaking to me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to me, “Son of man, I send you to the people of Israel, to a nation"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Syr: Heb nations"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of rebels, who have rebelled against me; they and their fathers have transgressed against me to this very day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The people also are impudent and stubborn: I send you to them; and you shall say to them, ‘Thus says the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ".’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And whether they hear or refuse to hear (for they are a rebellious house) they will know that there has been a prophet among them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you, son of man, be not afraid of them, nor be afraid of their words, though briers and thorns are with you and you sit upon scorpions; be not afraid of their words, nor be dismayed at their looks, for they are a rebellious house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you shall speak my words to them, whether they hear or refuse to hear; for they are a rebellious house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“But you, son of man, hear what I say to you; be not rebellious like that rebellious house; open your mouth, and eat what I give you.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when I looked, behold, a hand was stretched out to me, and lo, a written scroll was in it; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and he spread it before me; and it had writing on the front and on the back, and there were written on it words of lamentation and mourning and woe. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}